# Delivery Policy: Branch

Use an issue-aware branch and deliver it through the configured pull-request
practice.

## Rules

- Where a branch is required, use `<commit-type>/[<issue-id>-]<commit-slug>`.
- Apply the selected pull-request policy when creating or updating the pull
  request.
